png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-72b6a58b1ced1f26END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-66437df1eb7c0749END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_Memory_Crystal_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Memory_Crystal_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Memory_Crystal_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">157b3cd4-c446-4523-a0a8-8bdb8d40a76e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:157b3cd4-c446-4523-a0a8-8bdb8d40a76e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:157b3cd4-c446-4523-a0a8-8bdb8d40a76e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>Starting dialog and cutscenes on a successful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Arcana Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Arcana\" title=\"Arcana\">Arcana</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dhourn\" title=\"Dhourn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png/25px-Portrait_Dhourn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png/38px-Portrait_Dhourn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png/50px-Portrait_Dhourn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dhourn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png/25px-Portrait_Dhourn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Dhourn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dhourn\" title=\"Dhourn\">Dhourn</a>, one of the petrified drow to the west of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBnite_Outpost\" title=\"Selûnite Outpost\">Selûnite Outpost</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;121&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-245</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>There are three items that contain hints about the <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(location)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (location)\">Adamantine Forge</a> and advance the corresponding <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(quest)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (quest)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"quest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(quest)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (quest)\">quest</a>. Passing ability checks on all these three items grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#If_I_Can't_Have_It...\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"If I Can't Have It...\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#If_I_Can't_Have_It...\" title=\"Sage\">If I Can't Have It...</a> inspiration to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/30px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/40px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background. The other two items are:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scribbled_Notes\" title=\"Scribbled Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scribbled_Notes\" title=\"Scribbled Notes\">Scribbled Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Furnace_of_Grymforge\" title=\"The Great Furnace of Grymforge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Book_Tome_F_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Furnace_of_Grymforge\" title=\"The Great Furnace of Grymforge\">The Great Furnace of Grymforge</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Choosing to focus on the glow of the crystal results in the character taking minor damage.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195811\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4166/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43416/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14025/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1286892/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   77.176      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   77.176      1 -total\n 48.64%   37.536     14 Template:Icon_text\n 45